---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import SectionHead from "../components/SectionHead.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import thumbsUp from "../assets/images/thumbs up 05b.png";
const title = "Chris Kraft, Interaction Designer and Accessibility Advocate";
---

<Page>
  <main>
    <section class="flex flex-col items-center px-4 py-16">
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row max-w-6xl gap-8 lg:gap-0">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 w-full max-w-lg h-fit self-center">
          <h1 class="sr-only">The personal website of Chris Kraft, interaction designer and accessibility advocate.</h1>
          <div class="text-[5rem] text-indigo-900 font-serif font-extralight leading-[100%]">Hi, I'm <span class="font-normal">Chris</span></div>
          <div class="text-indigo-900 text-xl font-light leading-[150%]">I've been designing and building in the digital, internet, and print realms for over 26 years.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ml-[-80px]">
          <Image src={thumbsUp} alt="Krig Thumbs Up" class="w-full max-w-2xl" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 flex flex-col flex-nowrap gap-20">
      <SectionHead title="Highlighted Projects" />
    </section>
    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-indigo-50">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 typography">
        <h2 class="text-indi">Section Title</h2>
        <h3>Section Title</h3>
        <h4>Section Title</h4>
        <div>
          <ul class="formatted">
            <li>Vitae magna lacus aliquet quae nimis morbi.</li>
            <li>Nonummy regula tortor ligula pulvinar consectetuer iaceo felis feugiat. Per dolore ventosus zelus abbas valde.</li>
            <li>Bis at a lacus ornare dolor jus. Indoles iaceo tortor proprius ornare proin duis quae.</li>
            <li>Veniam quam felis vulputate decet ludus sagittis.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 typography">
        <h2>Section Title</h2>
        <div>
          <p>Vitae magna lacus aliquet quae nimis morbi. Nonummy regula tortor ligula pulvinar consectetuer iaceo felis feugiat. Per dolore ventosus zelus abbas valde.</p>
          <p>Bis at a lacus ornare dolor jus. Indoles iaceo tortor proprius ornare proin duis quae. Veniam quam felis vulputate decet ludus sagittis.</p>
          <p>Bis at a lacus ornare dolor jus. Indoles iaceo tortor proprius ornare proin duis quae. Veniam quam felis vulputate decet ludus sagittis.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Page>
